      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad protect my bike from scratches and damage during Bike Transportation In Karnal?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Every bike is first wrapped in our proprietary 7‑layer shock‑absorbent system, which combines heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard, weather‑proof stretch film, and custom wooden crates for delicate parts. The bike is then secured inside an enclosed multi‑axle trailer with hydraulic ramps, ensuring zero movement. Continuous GPS monitoring and a zero‑scratch guarantee further safeguard against any transit mishap.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What steps are involved in obtaining an instant bike transportation quote for a move from Karnal?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Start by filling the online quote form with bike details, pickup and drop‑off locations, and preferred date. Our system instantly calculates a transparent price, factoring in distance, bike type, and any special handling. After you confirm, we generate an IBA‑approved invoice that meets GST and e‑Way bill requirements, ready for corporate or government reimbursement.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any restrictions on the types of motorcycles or scooters that can be shipped through your bike parcel service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We handle a wide range of two‑wheelers, from commuter motorcycles and scooters to premium cruisers and sports bikes. The only limitations are for bikes exceeding 250 kg or those with non‑standard dimensions that cannot fit within our 18‑ft, 22‑ft, or 32‑ft MX containers. In such cases, we provide a custom solution after a brief consultation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the real‑time GPS tracking work and can I receive live updates on my bike’s journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each trailer is equipped with a satellite‑grade GPS unit linked to our 24/7 control center. As the bike moves along the 850 km highway corridor, you receive automatic SMS or email notifications at key milestones—departure, en‑route checkpoints, and arrival. You can also log into our client portal for a live map view, ensuring complete visibility throughout the transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is provided for Bike Transportation In Karnal and how are claims handled?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We offer 100 % declared‑value IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering loss, theft, and accidental damage. In the unlikely event of a claim, you submit the incident report and supporting photos within 48 hours. Our dedicated claims team processes the request swiftly, coordinating with insurers to settle the payout directly to you, without any hidden fees.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I combine bike transport with other services like car relocation or corporate office shifting?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Our fleet includes dedicated two‑wheel carrier trucks as well as larger container trucks for cars, office furniture, and household goods. You can schedule a combined move, benefiting from a single invoice, coordinated pickup, and unified tracking, which streamlines logistics for both personal and corporate relocation needs.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for interstate bike transport and does the invoice meet IBA standards?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">For interstate moves you’ll need the bike’s registration certificate, a valid GSTIN (if applicable), and a signed transport agreement. Our invoices are IBA‑approved, contain all statutory details, and are compliant with e‑Way bill regulations, making them acceptable for reimbursement claims by central, state, or PSU entities.</p>
